  The mark: a film reel wound out of concentric arcs, with a play triangle at its hub — the two
  things the app is, in one shape. Traced from icon_v01.svg.

  The artwork was drawn on its own 1495-unit disc; the group maps that disc onto the adaptive
  icon's central 72 units, so the disc's edge lands exactly on the circle a round mask cuts and the
  arcs meet it at the proportion they were drawn at. The disc itself is not redrawn here — the
  gradient behind it is @drawable/ic_launcher_background, full-bleed, so square and squircle masks
  are filled to their corners too.
-->
